description.p:
R4a is selected from H, 

 alkyl, alkyl-phenyl, and phenyl; 

alternatively, R4 and R a, together with the carbon to which they are attached, combine to form a 3-8 membered carbocyclic ring substituted with 0-3 Rb or a 3-8 membered heterocyclic ring containing from 1 -3 heteroatoms selected from N, O, and S(O)p and substituted with 0-3 Rb;

